OL,3,AOpenAI admits response to Australian
OL,4,Agovernment hacks 'not good enough'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI has admitted its actions were
OL,7,F"not good enough" after one of its
OL,8,Frogue agents breached Australian
OL,9,Fgovernment websites in June and said it
OL,10,Fhad added more precautions to its
OL,11,Ftraining environments.
OL,13,FThe company's chief strategy officer
OL,14,FJason Kwon faced a parliamentary
OL,15,Fhearing into AI on Tuesday in Sydney,
OL,16,Fsaying the breach "should not have
OL,17,Fhappened" and it "should have handled
OL,18,Four response better". It took weeks
OL,19,Fbefore Australia was notified via an
OL,20,Femail to a generic inbox.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
