OL,3,AOpenAI admits response to Australian
OL,4,Agovernment hacks 'not good enough'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are sorry and we know we have work
OL,7,Fto do to rebuild trust with the
OL,8,FAustralian people," Kwon said.
OL,10,FAnthropic also appeared and said it had
OL,11,Fnot found any cases of Australian
OL,12,Fbreaches during a recent investigation.
